    """`(repo_cls, read_all, entity, fields, detail)` for a service filter.

    A FILTER_BY_FIELD service with scalar-only parameters runs over the
    entity's read-all: the criteria are the kernel's own field matching, so
    the body filters exactly as the repository would. Anything else (no
    list entity in the return, an entity-typed parameter, an unmappable
    parameter, no read-all repository) is None — a stub, not a guess.
    """
